#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong><br/>Allow clients to book demos online</strong>"
msgstr "<strong><br/>ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຈອງການສາທິດອອນລາຍ</strong>"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><em>Example:<br/><br/>Milestone:</em></strong><em> Carbon Footprint "
"Analysis <br/></em><strong><em>Tasks:</em></strong><em> Collect Emissions "
"Data, Evaluate Resource Consumption, Prepare Initial Report</em>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><em>ຕົວຢ່າງ:<br/><br/>ເປົ້າໝາຍຫຼັກ:</em></strong><em> ການວິເຄາະຄາບອນຟຸດພຣິນ "
"<br/></em><strong><em>ໜ້າວຽກ:</em></strong><em> ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນການປ່ອຍອາຍພິດ, ປະເມີນການຊົ"
"ມໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ສ້າງບົດລາຍງານເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ</em>"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.ir_ui_view_3007
msgid "<strong>CSRD Compliance&amp;nbsp;</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ການປະຕິບັດຕາມ CSRD&amp;nbsp;</strong>"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Manage Your ESG Impacts with the ESG App</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຈັດການຜົນກະທົບດ້ານ ESG ຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍແອັບ ESG</strong>"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Manage leads and client relationships with CRM</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຈັດການລູກຄ້າກຸ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ ສາຍພົວພັນລູກຄ້າດ້ວຍ CRM</strong>"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Manage tasks </strong>by organizing them into stages such as 'To "
"Do,' 'In Progress,' and 'Done,' <strong>while collaborating with the team</"
"strong> by assigning deadlines and responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຈັດການໜ້າວຽກ </strong>ໂດຍຈັດແບ່ງອອກເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນ ເຊັ່ນ 'ທີ່ຈະເຮັດ', 'ກຳລັງດຳເນີນກາ"
"ນ', ແລະ 'ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ', <strong>ພ້ອມທັງເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບທີມງານ</strong> ໂດຍການກຳນົດກຳນົດເວລ"
"າ ແລະ ຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບ."

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Structure and track impactful projects</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ສ້າງໂຄງສ້າງ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມໂຄງການທີ່ມີຜົນກະທົບ</strong>"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Track billable hours for consulting services</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຕິດຕາມຊົ່ວໂມງທີ່ສາມາດເກັບເງິນໄດ້ສຳລັບການບໍລິການໃຫ້ຄຳປຶກສາ</strong>"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Upload key documents</strong>, such as client reports and regulatory "
"guidelines, directly into the dedicated project folder, accessible via the "
"smart button on the project page or in the <strong>Document App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ອັບໂຫຼດເອກະສານສຳຄັນ</strong>, ເຊັ່ນ: ບົດລາຍງານຂອງລູກຄ້າ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳຕາມລະບຽບກາ"
"ນ, ເຂົ້າໄປໃນໂຟນເດີໂຄງການໂດຍກົງ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານປຸ່ມ smart button ໃນໜ້າໂຄງການ ຫຼື ໃ"
"ນ <strong>ແອັບເອກະສານ</strong>."

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.ir_ui_view_3007
msgid ""
"Access specialized knowledge and innovative practices that enhance your "
"understanding and effectiveness in environmental stewardship"
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າເຖິງຄວາມຮູ້ສະເພາະດ້ານ ແລະ ແນວທາງປະຕິບັດທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍເສີມສ້າງຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈ ແລະ ປະສິດທິພາ"
"ບໃນການຄຸ້ມຄອງສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Access the Timesheet app via the <strong>smart button</strong> on the "
"project page to view timesheets related to the project or a specific task."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າເຖິງແອັບ Timesheet ຜ່ານ <strong>smart button</strong> ໃນໜ້າໂຄງການ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງໃບບັນທຶກ"
"ເວລາທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂຄງການ ຫຼື ໜ້າວຽກສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model:sale.order.template.line,name:environmental_agency.sale_order_template_line_5
msgid "Act"
msgstr "ລົງມືປະຕິບັດ"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid "Act on Your Data"
msgstr "ລົງມືປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Analyze <strong>pay gaps, gender parity, across leadership levels, "
"departments, contract types,...</strong>"
msgstr ""
"ວິເຄາະ <strong>ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງຄ່າຈ້າງ, ຄວາມສະເໝີພາບລະຫວ່າງເພດ, ໃນທົ່ວລະດັບການນຳ, ພະແນ"
"ກ, ປະເພດສັນຍາ,...</strong>"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Assign factors to your <strong>bill lines</strong> to get emitted emissions "
"linked to each purchase."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າປັດໄຈໃຫ້ກັບ <strong>ແຖວໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ</strong> ຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ການປ່ອຍອາຍພິດທີ່ເຊື່ອມ"
"ໂຍງກັບການສັ່ງຊື້ແຕ່ລະລາຍການ."

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid "Assign tasks and monitor progress to improve impacts."
msgstr "ມອບໝາຍໜ້າວຽກ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າເພື່ອປັບປຸງຜົນກະທົບໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

